          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 20,
          "description": "Key to send: single char (1, y, n), named key (enter, escape, tab, up, down, left, right, backspace, delete, home, end), or combo (ctrl+c, ctrl+d, ctrl+x, ctrl+z, shift+tab)"
        }
      },
